{
  "_file": "menu_sequence",
  "_readme": [
    "MargBooks ka menu -- JIS KRAM ME app me dikhta hai.",
    "",
    "Ye kram ASLI DUMP se aaya hai (form_item.txt, form_item_create.txt),",
    "andaze se nahi. Crawler isi kram me chalega -- DOM ka kram nahi dekhega,",
    "kyunki wo Angular ke render par badalta rehta hai.",
    "",
    "Naya menu aaye to yahan ek entry jod do. Code chhune ki zaroorat nahi.",
    "",
    "skip: true  ->  jaan-boojh kar chhoda. Har chhode hue item ko WAJAH ke",
    "saath likhna zaroori hai -- chupchaap chhodna sabse bura hai.",
    "create: true -> is page par form kholkar uske field bhi nikaale jayenge. List ke element se koi test nahi banta -- jo banta hai wo form ke field se banta hai. Form BINA SAVE KIYE band kar diya jata hai.",
    "formNames: form me jo naam LIKHA aata hai, agar wo menu ke naam se alag ho. MargBooks Ledger ko form me 'Party' kehta hai, Agency ko 'Company'. Iske bina crawler samajhta hai ki galat form khul gaya aur data chhod deta hai."
  ],
